der fans would  have learned that patience is a virtue  at this point on the day the movie  dropped the issues with hbo max  reportedly started around 2am  eastern and in under 9 hours the down  detector tracking site received no less  than 127 outage reports about the  streamer  according to the site's data things  remain somewhat problematic for the rest  of the day  with the biggest outage spike hitting  just before 7 pm 119 reports  reports continued to flood in until 11  pm suggesting this was not just a  temporary  issue the situation started to calm down  around midnight and by the wee hours of  march 19th everything seemed to be back  to normal across the network  regardless of what exactly caused the  problem the spike was pretty substantial  since hbo asia actually addressed it  for context when game of thrones season  8 premiered in 2019 and folks took to  social media with similar outage issues  hbo specifically told entertainment  weekly that it didn't quote  experience any service outages on hbo go  or hbo now in the us during  last night's game of thrones season 8  premiere does this mean that zack  snyder's justice league blew the  premiere of game of thrones final season  out of the water  the final numbers remain to be seen but  the fact that zack snyder's justice  league's release coincided with so many  reported issues on hbo max sure seems to  speak  volumes of the project's popularity at  the moment all indications are that this  precedent setting experiment in  revisionist filmmaking has been a  resounding success  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite dc eu movies are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

